WEBVTT

00:41:58.163 --> 00:42:04.246
Well, thank you to I think everybody
listening should remember that every

00:42:04.246 --> 00:42:09.746
single day we live, each one of us
makes an impact on the planet.

00:42:10.038 --> 00:42:13.371
And we have a choice as to what
kind of impact we make.

00:42:14.038 --> 00:42:16.496
That's a really important
thing to remember.

00:42:17.871 --> 00:42:19.913
Scientists, conservationist,

00:42:20.121 --> 00:42:25.246
activist Jane Goodall now has a new title
to add to her collection podcast,

00:42:25.288 --> 00:42:29.204
her her new show is called The
Jane Goodall Hope Cast.

00:42:29.871 --> 00:42:31.246
It's currently available in English,